### Agent Type Capabilities

| Type | Behavior | Example | Advantage |
|------|----------|---------|-----------|
| **Reactive** | Waits for request, responds | "How do I reset password?" | 24/7 availability |
| **Proactive** | Acts before being asked | "I see you viewed pricing—here's a demo" | Surprise customers, boost conversion |
| **Learning** | Improves from experience | "Based on 1000 similar tickets, I know this answer" | Less human maintenance, better accuracy |
| **Swarm** | Teams up dynamically | 50 agents handle Black Friday surge | Unlimited scalability, resilience |

